{"id": "EUVD-2026-71147", "enisaUuid": "a8084974-805e-3ca6-bcf2-241bcc603574", "description": "Turso through 0.8.0-pre.8 contains an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the table-leaf page reader that uses an attacker-controlled cell-count field without bounds validation. Attackers can craft a malicious database file with a modified cell count value to trigger an index-out-of-bounds panic when querying, causing denial of service in any application that opens untrusted database files.", "datePublished": "2026-09-04T14:32:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T19:33:08", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/tursodatabase/turso/issues/7473", "https://github.com/tursodatabase/turso", "https://github.com/tursodatabase/turso/blob/v0.8.0-pre.8/core/storage/pager.rs", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/turso-through-0.8.0-pre.8-out-of-bounds-read-denial-of-service"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-85698", "GHSA-xvgm-8rpx-fmg6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "75029a82-c894-338e-a01e-30a4cffe4b60", "product": {"name": "turso", "vendor": {"name": "tursodatabase"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.8.0-pre.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "79fe325d-f2b0-3db6-bc05-b16efca2b0bd", "vendor": {"name": "tursodatabase"}}], "isExploited": false}